Package: com.samcejko.artlight
Name: Artlight
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Game streaming from your own PC for iOS 6 (universal): plays games from Sunshine and Apollo hosts (the protocol of Moonlight and Artemis), PIN and one-time-PIN pairing, app list with box art, hardware H.264 decoding, touch gamepad, mouse and keyboard
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Games
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
